    "m_FunctionSource": "",
    "m_FunctionBody": "FragPositionWS -= NormalWS * DistortionStrength;\r\nfloat fragToCamSqrDistance = dot(_WorldSpaceCameraPos.xyz - FragPositionWS, _WorldSpaceCameraPos.xyz - FragPositionWS); //SqrDistance\r\nfloat refWorldPosToCamSqrDistance = (SceneDepth * SceneDepth * fragToCamSqrDistance) / (SurfaceDepth * SurfaceDepth);\r\n\r\nfloat3 fragWorldDir = normalize(FragPositionWS - _WorldSpaceCameraPos.xyz);\r\nfloat3 refWorldPos = fragWorldDir * sqrt(refWorldPosToCamSqrDistance) + _WorldSpaceCameraPos.xyz;\r\n\r\nCausticPositionWS = refWorldPos;"
